sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant L as Learner
 participant M as Moodle + plugin
 participant V as Version Resolver
 participant DB as Learning Registry
 participant C as Content Storage
 L->>M: First meaningful learning action
 M->>V: Resolve via authenticated context
 V->>DB: Find LearningInstance with lock
 alt Exists
  DB-->>V: Pinned curriculum & content refs
 else Missing
  V->>DB: Atomic create instance and R1 from stable published version
  DB-->>V: Locked plan and refs
 end
 V-->>M: Signed launch for immutable content artifact
 M->>C: iframe load authorized artifact
 C-->>L: Pinned HTML + assets
 Note over M,DB: New course releases do not alter the lock
